        <h2 class="hero-subheading">Portland Estate Sales &amp; Personal Property Appraisals.</h2>
        <p class="hero-lead">For more than 30 years, Portland families, attorneys, collectors, and fiduciaries have trusted Gary Germer &amp; Associates to appraise, manage, and sell significant personal property.</p>
        <div class="hero-ctas">
          <a class="button button-primary" href="#consultation" data-need="An estate">Discuss an Estate</a>
          <a class="button button-on-dark" href="#consultation" data-need="An appraisal">Request an Appraisal</a>
        </div>
        <p class="hero-proof"><strong>4.7 Stars on Google Reviews.</strong> Serving Portland and the Pacific Northwest.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-form-card home-hero-card">
        <h2>How can we help?</h2>
        <form class="form-grid" id="hero-form" action="/api/submit-inquiry" method="POST" novalidate>
          <input type="hidden" name="form" value="contact">
          <div class="form-honey" aria-hidden="true">
            <label for="hero-company">Leave this field empty</label>
            <input type="text" id="hero-company" name="_honey" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">
