  <!-- =========================== ABOUT GARY =========================== -->
  <section class="section" id="about-gary">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-band-grid">
        <div class="about-copy-panel">
          <p class="eyebrow">An Eye Developed Over a Lifetime</p>
          <h2 class="section-heading about-heading">About Gary Germer</h2>
          <div class="about-bio">
            <p>For more than 30 years, Gary Germer has worked with antiques, fine art, personal property, appraisals, and estate sales. Families and attorneys value his scholarship, candor, visual judgment, humor, and warmth.</p>
            <p>A native of Vancouver, WA, Gary Germer studied art history at the Pacific Northwest College of Art. He then apprenticed under the mentorship of Mr. Bob Rau, host of the very popular PBS program, &ldquo;The Collectors.&rdquo;</p>
            <p>Since then, Gary has helped thousands of families appraise and sell their finery. Gary&rsquo;s expertise is highly regarded, which is why he&rsquo;s appeared on several television and radio shows, including KPTV Fox 12&rsquo;s Good Day Oregon, KATU AM Northwest, KGAL, and KSHO.</p>
            <p>He also works with elite corporate clients such as bank trust offices, non-profit organizations, and insurance companies. Recently, he has supported fire victims by serving as an expert witness on high-profile insurance cases.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="about-portrait-wrap reveal">
