            <img src="/assets/images/video-still-2.jpg" srcset="/assets/images/video-still-2.webp 800w" sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 30vw" width="800" height="450" loading="lazy" alt="Gary Germer presenting a Navajo silver and turquoise jewelry collection">
            <span class="video-thumb-play"><span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 5.5v13l11-6.5-11-6.5Z" fill="currentColor"/></svg></span></span>
          </a>
          <a class="video-thumb" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=klALIyPrhD4" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-video="/assets/videos/gary-germer-show-and-tell.mp4" aria-label="Play video: Show and Tell with Tony, featuring Gary Germer, professional appraiser">
            <img src="/assets/images/video-still-3.jpg" srcset="/assets/images/video-still-3.webp 800w" sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 30vw" width="800" height="450" loading="lazy" alt="Gary Germer appraising items for Fox 12's Show and Tell with Tony">
            <span class="video-thumb-play"><span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 5.5v13l11-6.5-11-6.5Z" fill="currentColor"/></svg></span></span>
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="video-row-cta">
          <a class="button button-navy" href="/blog/?filter=video">Watch More Videos</a>
          <a class="button button-secondary" href="/our-services/speaking-engagements-and-clinics/">Learn About Gary&rsquo;s Speaking Engagements</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- =========================== CONSIGNMENT =========================== -->
  <section class="split on-dark" id="consignment">
    <div class="split-inner">
    <div class="split-copy">
      <div class="split-copy-inner">
        <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-on-dark">Consignment Services</p>
        <h2 class="section-heading">The Right Market for the Right Objects</h2>
        <p class="section-body section-body-on-dark">Gary Germer &amp; Associates is the region&rsquo;s leading purveyor of fine items. When it comes to consignment, our mission is to go out into the world and put your objects in front of the highest paying collectors &mdash; wherever they may be.</p>
        <p class="section-body section-body-on-dark">We use a variety of methods to bring your valuables to market. Your items may find a buyer at our brick-and-mortar Portland shop, eBay, or across any number of the other specialized marketplaces. We also have a mailing list of thousands excited to hear about our latest consignment offerings.</p>
        <div class="about-cta split-cta-row">
          <a class="button button-on-dark" href="/our-services/consignment/">Consignment Services</a>
          <a class="button button-secondary" href="https://shop.garygermer.com/collections/newly-listed">Shop for Treasures</a>
