          </form>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ========================== TESTIMONIALS ========================== -->
  <section class="section on-dark" id="testimonials">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-heading testimonial-heading">More Than 10,000<br>Families Have Trusted Us</h2>

      <div class="testimonial-row reveal">
        <div class="testimonial">
          <span class="testimonial-mark" aria-hidden="true">&ldquo;</span>
          <p class="testimonial-quote">I had the pleasure of working with Gary Germer &amp; Associates for an appraisal and was thoroughly impressed with the level of professionalism and expertise. Not only was the appraisal evaluation quick and accurate, but it was presented in a clear and comprehensive manner, making it easy for me to understand the value.</p>
          <p class="testimonial-attribution">&mdash; Austin H., Appraisal Client</p>
        </div>
        <div class="testimonial">
          <span class="testimonial-mark" aria-hidden="true">&ldquo;</span>
          <p class="testimonial-quote">We go to lots of estate sales and Gary Germer&rsquo;s sales are always heads above the rest. Gary has a real respect and almost reverence for people&rsquo;s belongings. Everything is so beautifully displayed. We always leave his sales laughing and with something unique for our home.</p>
          <p class="testimonial-attribution">&mdash; Brad Thomas, Estate Sale Client</p>
        </div>
        <div class="testimonial">
          <span class="testimonial-mark" aria-hidden="true">&ldquo;</span>
          <p class="testimonial-quote">Gary and his team were professional, highly responsive, and navigated a complex situation with care and expertise. The estate sale itself was well-organized, well-staffed, and ran smoothly. I would not hesitate to recommend Gary Germer &amp; Associates to anyone navigating an estate sale.</p>
          <p class="testimonial-attribution">&mdash; M.R. | Estate Sale Client</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="testimonial-proof-row">
        <div class="google-badge">
          <span class="google-badge-label">Google Reviews</span>
          <img class="testimonial-proof-badge" src="/assets/images/google-reviews-badge.png" width="556" height="118" loading="lazy" alt="Rating: 4.7 stars from 123 reviews">
